h3 2.6.3 Using reflect in specifications
text is primarily about improving web developer ergonomics by giving them typed access to content attributes through . The ultimate source of truth, which the web platform builds upon, is the content attributes themselves. That is, specification authors must not use the  getter or setter steps, but instead must use the content attribute presence and value. (Or an abstraction on top, such as the state of an .)
